1
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,550
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:47,050
[Episode 32]

3
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:47,430
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:01,480
Excuse me.

6
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:02,410
Coming through.

7
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,240
Hold on tight.

8
00:01:47,289 --> 00:01:48,520
How did you get this?

9
00:01:49,310 --> 00:01:50,800
Mom said

10
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,940
it was for her future son-in-law.

11
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:55,110
I treasured it too much to wear it.

12
00:01:55,190 --> 00:01:56,160
And later,

13
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:00,160
it became even more precious.

14
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,120
Thank you.

15
00:02:07,790 --> 00:02:09,120
I heard what happened

16
00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:10,320
to your father.

17
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:17,450
[His Legacy Lives On]

18
00:02:19,290 --> 00:02:21,650
[His Legacy Lives On]

19
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,580
I'm so sorry for your loss.

20
00:03:10,650 --> 00:03:11,840
If there's nothing else,

21
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,960
I'll get going.

22
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:15,880
Stay for dinner.

23
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,360
I just came from--

24
00:03:19,370 --> 00:03:20,360
Sorry.

25
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,640
Mom, when are you coming home?

26
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,460
I'll be home tomorrow.

27
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:33,180
How about you?

28
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:34,620
Have you been eating properly?

29
00:03:34,620 --> 00:03:36,720
Of course. I've been good.

30
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:38,740
Where's Yi Muyang?

31
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:39,870
Put him on the phone.

32
00:03:40,010 --> 00:03:41,410
I'm right here, Tinglan.

33
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:46,860
I thought this was our secret.

34
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:48,640
Even from my mom?

35
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,260
Especially from your mom.

36
00:03:50,290 --> 00:03:51,400
You little monkey.

37
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,440
What happened?

38
00:03:54,650 --> 00:03:55,680
Mom,

39
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:58,280
Yi Muyang hurt his ankle.

40
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,480
He's at the hospital.

41
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,360
He told me not to tell you.

42
00:04:02,790 --> 00:04:03,790
Give me the phone.

43
00:04:05,290 --> 00:04:06,040
Tinglan,

44
00:04:06,340 --> 00:04:07,480
I'm fine.

45
00:04:08,050 --> 00:04:09,140
It's nothing serious.

46
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:11,120
You got hurt and didn't tell me?

47
00:04:11,140 --> 00:04:12,660
And you're looking after He?

48
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:14,120
I'm coming home right now.

49
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,079
Uh-oh.

50
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:19,240
Guess you got your wish.

51
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:22,290
Shu Nianhe, what's that supposed to mean?

52
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,880
You think I did this on purpose?

53
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:25,040
Well, didn't you?

54
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:26,200
I-I...

55
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,720
Do I look like I'd do that?

56
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,250
Keep it up and no more candy.

57
00:04:29,650 --> 00:04:30,720
Spit it out.

58
00:04:36,670 --> 00:04:37,670
I'll walk you out.

59
00:04:37,970 --> 00:04:38,880
No, thanks.

60
00:04:46,530 --> 00:04:47,440
Zhuo Yu'an.

61
00:04:48,740 --> 00:04:50,520
I finally managed to start over

62
00:04:51,650 --> 00:04:53,040
and built a new life.

63
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:55,909
I don't want to go through it again.

64
00:04:58,159 --> 00:04:59,960
Whatever Yi Muyang can give you,

65
00:05:00,850 --> 00:05:01,910
I can give you, too.

66
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,000
And what he can't give you,

67
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:04,800
I can.

68
00:05:04,970 --> 00:05:06,200
What's wrong between us

69
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,800
was never about anyone else.

70
00:05:09,210 --> 00:05:10,520
It's us.

71
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,280
Whatever it is,

72
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,480
I can change.

73
00:05:24,510 --> 00:05:26,240
He isn't a problem.

74
00:05:27,030 --> 00:05:28,560
Nothing else is, either.

75
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,300
What would you change?

76
00:05:32,980 --> 00:05:34,420
You didn't do anything wrong.

77
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:35,880
Then what is it?

78
00:05:40,860 --> 00:05:42,760
I've asked myself that, too.

79
00:05:43,810 --> 00:05:44,840
Why is it

80
00:05:45,170 --> 00:05:47,280
that whenever I get close to happy,

81
00:05:47,970 --> 00:05:49,840
something gets in the way?

82
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,560
Like fate's doing it on purpose.

83
00:05:55,170 --> 00:05:56,640
Then it hit me.

84
00:05:59,790 --> 00:06:01,480
We're too much alike.

85
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,320
We carry too much.

86
00:06:03,350 --> 00:06:04,150
We think too much.

87
00:06:04,150 --> 00:06:05,680
And we can't hold on.

88
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:10,360
Let's leave it at that.

89
00:06:36,940 --> 00:06:38,800
We're too much alike.

90
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:40,700
We carry too much.

91
00:06:40,700 --> 00:06:41,520
We think too much.

92
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:43,100
And we can't hold on.

93
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,320
So you found Shu Tinglan.

94
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,920
Look at you now.

95
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,730
Zhuoyuan's tech is back on track,

96
00:07:04,730 --> 00:07:06,040
and so are you.

97
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:08,450
Zhuoyuan Technology won't go under.

98
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:09,860
And neither will I.

99
00:07:11,350 --> 00:07:12,680
So, did you get her back?

100
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,840
Knew you didn't.

101
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:18,690
You know what Shu Tinglan's like.

102
00:07:18,690 --> 00:07:20,160
Even if you begged on your knees,

103
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:22,020
she wouldn't come back that easy.

104
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:25,440
Wait. You actually did?

105
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,520
If you've got nothing to say, leave.

106
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:29,380
You're the one who called me here.

107
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,440
[Zhuoyuan Technology
Investment Proposal]

108
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:33,030
Zhuoyuan Technology seeks funding.

109
00:07:33,030 --> 00:07:34,310
I'd like Tingjing Finance

110
00:07:34,310 --> 00:07:35,720
to consider investing.

111
00:07:36,930 --> 00:07:37,070
[Zhuoyuan Technology
Investment Proposal]

112
00:07:41,350 --> 00:07:42,840
Well, damn.

113
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,550
You're setting a trap

114
00:07:44,550 --> 00:07:45,680
for Ruixin.

115
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:49,460
Ruixin's tech has been pieced together

116
00:07:49,460 --> 00:07:51,159
for years.

117
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,320
Its books are full of holes.

118
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,610
And Wen Jian has spent years

119
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:56,570
using shady tricks

120
00:07:56,570 --> 00:07:58,440
to keep it all buried.

121
00:07:58,790 --> 00:08:00,600
Once outside investors come in,

122
00:08:01,140 --> 00:08:02,880
she won't be able to hide it.

123
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,220
You're doing all this

124
00:08:05,250 --> 00:08:06,040
to get even

125
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,680
for Ms. Shu, aren't you?

126
00:08:10,460 --> 00:08:12,520
I'm cleaning house.

127
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:22,960
[Lanshan Law Firm]

128
00:08:22,770 --> 00:08:25,040
Ms. Shu, your client is waiting
in the meeting room.

129
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,480
Okay. Thanks.

130
00:08:37,990 --> 00:08:39,039
What do you want?

131
00:08:42,770 --> 00:08:44,480
Easy, Ms. Shu.

132
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:46,560
I'm here to talk business.

133
00:08:47,890 --> 00:08:49,000
Have a seat.

134
00:08:57,260 --> 00:08:58,330
I'd like you

135
00:08:58,350 --> 00:09:00,150
to handle this professionally.

136
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,080
I'm sorry,

137
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:05,040
Mr. Zhuo.

138
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:06,560
I misunderstood you.

139
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,600
So, Mr. Zhuo,

140
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,280
what can I help you with?

141
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,800
The legal aid center's IP case.

142
00:09:16,300 --> 00:09:17,120
[IP Infringement Lawsuit Against Ruixin]

143
00:09:17,150 --> 00:09:17,690
[Legal Representation Agreement]

144
00:09:20,790 --> 00:09:23,170
The victim was a key employee

145
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:25,860
at Zhuoyuan Technology
before joining Ruixin.

146
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:28,060
Now Ruixin's new products

147
00:09:28,090 --> 00:09:30,000
look almost identical

148
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,000
to what Zhuoyuan Technology makes.

149
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,200
I have reason to suspect Ruixin

150
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:35,200
brought him in to use our IP

151
00:09:35,310 --> 00:09:37,720
without permission.

152
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:42,880
This case is complicated.

153
00:09:43,060 --> 00:09:45,790
Are you sure you want to get involved
in this mess?

154
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:48,760
This isn't some mess.

155
00:09:50,020 --> 00:09:53,220
It's about protecting our company's
legitimate rights.

156
00:09:57,130 --> 00:09:57,850
Ms. Shu,

157
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:59,480
you've won cases like this.

158
00:09:59,900 --> 00:10:00,900
That's why I can trust you

159
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:02,240
with this one.

160
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:06,080
Mr. Zhuo,

161
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:08,190
are you doing this for the company,

162
00:10:08,210 --> 00:10:10,160
or is this your chance

163
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:12,100
to settle things with Wen Jian?

164
00:10:16,210 --> 00:10:18,320
Does it matter?

165
00:10:20,390 --> 00:10:21,720
If it's for the company,

166
00:10:22,900 --> 00:10:24,240
I'll consider taking the case.

167
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,440
But if it's personal,

168
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,080
count me out.

169
00:10:27,830 --> 00:10:28,920
Still, I hope

170
00:10:28,980 --> 00:10:30,560
I've got you wrong.

171
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:32,160
After all,

172
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,360
you always keep business
and personal matters separate,

173
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,400
right?

174
00:10:42,890 --> 00:10:43,880
Ms. Shu.

175
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:46,080
you've changed a lot over the years.

176
00:10:48,690 --> 00:10:50,290
Business and personal, huh?

177
00:10:56,620 --> 00:10:58,000
You may draw that line.

178
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,800
I don't.

179
00:11:00,580 --> 00:11:02,040
I only want one thing.

180
00:11:03,940 --> 00:11:05,480
Sue Ruixin.

181
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:06,560
And win.

182
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,040
Tinglan.

183
00:11:18,770 --> 00:11:20,640
You still haven't agreed

184
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:22,120
to take Mr. Zhuo's case?

185
00:11:24,130 --> 00:11:25,640
Landing a major client

186
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,520
would be great for our firm

187
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:29,040
this early on.

188
00:11:31,350 --> 00:11:32,360
I know.

189
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,500
It's a great opportunity.

190
00:11:35,390 --> 00:11:37,200
Then why the hesitation?

191
00:11:40,770 --> 00:11:42,370
I'm still figuring that out.

192
00:11:47,850 --> 00:11:49,120
I'll leave you to it.
